{"projectInfo":{"name":"IPv6 IS-IS与BFD联动配置","path":"isis_ipv6_bfd","visibility":2,"categoryId":39,"introduction":"Router A、Router B通过二层交换机互连，并且在双方接口上使能BFD应用，之间运行IPv6 IS-IS，网络层相互可达。当Router B和二层交换机之间的链路发生故障后，BFD能够快速检测并通告IPv6 IS-IS协议。","label":["ISIS"]},"deviceInfoList":[{"resourceName":"RTA","resourceCategory":"路由器","resourceModel":"MSR36-20","resourceVersion":"CMW7.1.064-R0821P11","configPath":"DeviceConfig\\RTA.cfg"},{"resourceName":"RTC","resourceCategory":"路由器","resourceModel":"MSR36-20","resourceVersion":"CMW7.1.064-R0821P11","configPath":"DeviceConfig\\RTC.cfg"},{"resourceName":"RTB","resourceCategory":"路由器","resourceModel":"MSR36-20","resourceVersion":"CMW7.1.064-R0821P11","configPath":"DeviceConfig\\RTB.cfg"},{"resourceName":"SW","resourceCategory":"交换机","resourceModel":"S5820V2-54QS-GE","resourceVersion":"CMW7.1.075-A7571","configPath":"DeviceConfig\\SW.cfg"}]}